---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const ascent = [
  {
    heading: "Design system and accessibility",
    items: [
      "Created Ascent's design system from scratch: more than 100 React components built on MUI, following Material 3 and customised for the brand, with usage and accessibility guidelines for each component.",
      "Wrote the accessibility guidelines and component changes needed to meet WCAG 2.1 AA, covering keyboard use, focus, contrast and ARIA.",
      "Leading the migration of the live app onto the new accessible system, about half complete, auditing each page's UI and UX and redesigning where needed.",
      "Restructured the colour theme into light and dark roles to ship dark mode, and to support white-label skins in each client's brand colours.",
      "Redesigning the platform, built for desktop only, to work on mobile, borrowers first, with every redesigned component responsive.",
      "Designed the team's Claude Code workflow for the design system: commands that create, review and check usage of components, audit pages into Jira tickets and run those tickets end to end, plus a coaching agent for junior engineers.",
    ],
  },
  {
    heading: "Product design and front end",
    items: [
      "Design and ship new features end to end, from discovery with founders, clients and lenders to release.",
      "Led the loan reviews and renewals feature, replacing email, letters and fax with one trackable flow for lenders and borrowers.",
      "Prototype in working code with Claude Code and Claude artifacts built on the design system, so stakeholders and engineers review real UI, not static files.",
      "Build front-end UI in React with Claude Code, and hand off cleanly to engineers for back-end work.",
      "Built Claude Code quality-control commands that developers run on front-end work, catching design system, accessibility and consistency issues before code review.",
    ],
  },
  {
    heading: "Leadership",
    items: [
      "Stepped up as lead UX designer: guide and give structured feedback to junior designers and support their onboarding.",
      "Work daily with founders, product managers and engineers to set priorities and balance user needs with business goals.",
      "Review every pull request that touches UI, from any developer, for component use, guidelines, consistency and UX.",
      "Ran remote research sessions with a US lender client, then designed and built the front end of the fixes: a reviews overview, a documents overview and request deduplication.",
    ],
  },
];

const frank = [
  "Audited and redesigned the Shopify store with Claude Code, from priorities to production code and data.",
  "Rebuilt navigation around how people shop for gifts: by product, occasion and interest. Added 11 occasion collections and 4 storefront filters.",
  "Rewrote, tagged and added alt text to 191 products using scripted bulk edits with dry runs, backups and verification.",
  "Fixed a header menu that closed on tap, adding keyboard (Escape) support and 48 px targets, and shipped it to the live store.",
  "Made personalisation clearer: a \"how it works\" homepage section and a longer, better-labelled engraving text field.",
];
---

<Base title="CV | Rachel Reid">
  <article class="container cv">
    <header class="cv-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">CV</p>
        <h1>Rachel Reid</h1>
        <p class="tagline">Senior Product Designer · Design Systems · Accessibility · Builds with Claude Code</p>
        <p class="contact">Glasgow, UK · <a href="mailto:rachel.myinbox@gmail.com">rachel.myinbox@gmail.com</a> · <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rachel-reid-406559229/">LinkedIn</a></p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/rachel-reid-cv.pdf" download="Rachel Reid CV.pdf">Download PDF</a>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2>Profile</h2>
      <div>
        <p>Product designer with four years at fintech startup Ascent Platform, from early stage to Series A. I created the company's design system from scratch in React and MUI, made it WCAG compliant, and am now leading the app's migration onto it.</p>
        <p>I design and build front-end UI with Claude Code, prototyping in working code on the real design system instead of static mock-ups. I work with international clients, including lenders in the US.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Experience</h2>
      <div>
        <div class="role">
          <h3>Product Experience Specialist (Lead UX/UI Designer)</h3>
          <p class="meta">Ascent Platform, via Hollis Creative · July 2022 – present</p>
        </div>
        {ascent.map((group) => (
          <>
            <h4>{group.heading}</h4>
            <ul>{group.items.map((i) => <li>{i}</li>)}</ul>
          </>
        ))}

        <div class="role">
          <h3>Product Designer (freelance)</h3>
          <p class="meta"><a href="/work/frank-bean">Frank Bean Market</a> · Oct 2026 – present</p>
        </div>
        <ul>{frank.map((i) => <li>{i}</li>)}</ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Skills</h2>
      <div>
        <p><strong>Design:</strong> product discovery, user flows, end-to-end feature design, design systems, Material 3, accessibility (WCAG 2.1 AA), prototyping, journey mapping</p>
        <p><strong>AI and build:</strong> Claude Code, Claude artifacts, React, MUI, Storybook, Git and GitHub, Shopify</p>
        <p><strong>Tools:</strong> Figma (advanced), VS Code, Notion, Excalidraw, Adobe Creative Cloud</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Education</h2>
      <div>
        <p><strong>BSc (Hons) Digital Interaction Design, 2:1</strong> · University of Dundee, 2022</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .cv { padding-top: var(--s-9); }
  .cv-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; gap: var(--s-5); padding-bottom: var(--s-6); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .cv-head h1 { margin-top: var(--s-3); }
  .tagline { margin-top: var(--s-3); font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); }
  .contact { margin-top: var(--s-2); color: var(--ink-3); }
  section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 220px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--s-6); padding: var(--s-6) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  section h2 { font-size: 1.125rem; }
  section > div { max-width: var(--measure); display: grid; gap: var(--s-3); }
  .role { margin-top: var(--s-3); }
  .role h3 { font-size: 1.125rem; }
  .meta { color: var(--ink-3); font-size: 0.9375rem; margin-top: 2px; }
  h4 { font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--ink); margin: var(--s-2) 0 0; }
  ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2em; display: grid; gap: var(--s-2); }
  strong { color: var(--ink); }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--s-3); } }
</style>
